        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Todd Field, Zoltan Korda, Jane Adams\n- Films: Little Children, Happiness, Wonder Boys, Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind\n- Roles: actor, filmmaker, screenwriter, director, producer, actress\n\nFacts:\n- Zoltan Korda was a Hungarian-born motion picture screenwriter, director, and producer who lived from June 3, 1895 to October 13, 1961.\n- Todd Field was born on February 24, 1964 and is an American actor and three-time Academy Award-nominated filmmaker.\n- Jane Adams appeared in the film Happiness in 1998.\n- Jane Adams appeared in the film Wonder Boys in 2000.\n- Jane Adams appeared in the film Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind in 2004.\n- Little Children is a 2006 American drama film directed by Todd Field.\n- Jane Adams appeared in the film Little Children in 2006.",
